{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanse the system of pirate presence, destroy their bases and free everyone who fell into their hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the asteroids, build your first generators, start refineries, explore asteroids and extract resources necessary for survival.<br>Over time, you will develop industry, unlock new types of ships and weapon systems, rescue survivors from the pirates\u2019 hands and transform a lonely rock into a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated system</strong><br>Each playthrough is a new layout of asteroids, resource points and enemy stations arranged differently each time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base construction and development</strong><br>Build habitats, ports, power plants, refineries and defense towers. Upgrades unlock new productions and ship types.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining and processing</strong><br>Explore asteroids, mine deposits manually, with mining ships or build automated mines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining colonies</strong><br>Develop the infrastructure of mines, ports and transport networks to efficiently move resources between colonies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space exploration</strong><br>Locate wrecks, rescue survivors from pirate ships, intercept convoys and destroy pirate bases in distant sectors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base defense</strong><br>Plan the layout of buildings in terms of energy and firing fields. Pirate raids escalate over time, and every gap in the system can be fatal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship combat</strong><br>From light fighters to heavy frigates \u2013 dynamic battles in space using lasers and rockets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light space survival focused on free play, base building and dynamic space battles.<br>Explore, develop and fight \u2013 step by step regain control over the system that pirates have claimed as their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is constantly being developed \u2014 bugs or technical issues may occur and will be fixed in future updates.<br>Thank you for reporting feedback and for your support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138820?t=1768146047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138820?t=1768146047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/b57d97d8fbba01184b6f558600acdb19a2808868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768146047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/b57d97d8fbba01184b6f558600acdb19a2808868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768146047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanse the system of pirate presence, destroy their bases and free everyone who fell into their hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the asteroids, build your first generators, start refineries, explore asteroids and extract resources necessary for survival.<br>Over time, you will develop industry, unlock new types of ships and weapon systems, rescue survivors from the pirates\u2019 hands and transform a lonely rock into a fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated system</strong><br>Each playthrough is a new layout of asteroids, resource points and enemy stations arranged differently each time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base construction and development</strong><br>Build habitats, ports, power plants, refineries and defense towers. Upgrades unlock new productions and ship types.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining and processing</strong><br>Explore asteroids, mine deposits manually, with mining ships or build automated mines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining colonies</strong><br>Develop the infrastructure of mines, ports and transport networks to efficiently move resources between colonies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space exploration</strong><br>Locate wrecks, rescue survivors from pirate ships, intercept convoys and destroy pirate bases in distant sectors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base defense</strong><br>Plan the layout of buildings in terms of energy and firing fields. Pirate raids escalate over time, and every gap in the system can be fatal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship combat</strong><br>From light fighters to heavy frigates \u2013 dynamic battles in space using lasers and rockets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light space survival focused on free play, base building and dynamic space battles.<br>Explore, develop and fight \u2013 step by step regain control over the system that pirates have claimed as their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is constantly being developed \u2014 bugs or technical issues may occur and will be fixed in future updates.<br>Thank you for reporting feedback and for your support!</p>","developers":["Krystian Dobaczewski"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138820/79b8f65ec034f7da67ddc95961294974a369ffd8/header.jpg?t=1768146047","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138820/485231015/3ea99755ad509415ec4ead4cece84a4a2f4fe59d/1765687543/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765695567","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138820/485231015/3ea99755ad509415ec4ead4cece84a4a2f4fe59d/1765687543/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765695567","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138820/485231015/3ea99755ad509415ec4ead4cece84a4a2f4fe59d/1765687543/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765695567","id":257249354,"name":"Combat","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/